    "prior_context": {
      "exploration_offsets_not_used": "median label - (takeoff - motion_start) on regular gate rows of the recipe months: EDDF 60.5 s, EHAM 6.9 s",
      "note": "Declared AFTER an exploratory look at the development rows (disclosed): on the 198 newly gate-matched no-NM rows of the four recipe months, v34's RMSE is 236 s, the raw ADS-B taxi (with an offset from those same months' regular gate rows) 216 s, the 50/50 blend 142 s (every month better), 75/25 160 s. The candidate scores below were NOT computed under this declaration's offsets before it was written.",
